# The notes queue is a working store; render it to Markdown to share it.
dass-notes.db
dass-notes.db-wal
dass-notes.db-shm

# HANDOFF.md is the tracked artifact and this is the store behind it, so git
# history stays readable prose rather than binary churn.  The cost is that the
# per-entry edit history lives only here; the prose itself is safe in git.
dass-handoff.db
dass-handoff.db-wal
dass-handoff.db-shm
